    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "CPU / 内存故障",
      "description": "CPU 数量按 Processor 类传感器统计。\n内存故障 = 状态非 Normal 的内存插槽数(ECC 报警、预测性故障)。\n注:内存**容量**和**实际插了几条** IPMI 读不到 —— BMC 只上报插槽健康状态,空槽同样会上报,所以「插槽数」不等于「内存条数」,这里不再显示它。",
      "datasource": null,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      },
      "id": 44,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "内存故障"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "thresholds"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "color": "green",
                      "value": null
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "red",
                      "value": 1
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(ipmi_sensor_state{instance=\"$instance\", type=\"Processor\"}) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "CPU 数",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "count(ipmi_sensor_state{instance=\"$instance\", type=\"Memory\"} != 0) or vector(0)",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "内存故障",
          "refId": "B"
        }
